From 125b3327fda4acc38428d54d9a7bfdb6837459cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GrgaPalcic <26028466+GrgaPalcic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] glm cuda: --learn-conversations beside TF_KV_SHARE, unsharded

A kept state's rows may be the store's pages: a Kept view over them, a pages layout in the disk image beside the copy one, write-behind in pieces under the staging permit, recall into pool pages. The disk identity probe runs with the shared store standing aside. Sharded stays refused by name until the next patches.
